== Data (downloaded at runtime or imported locally; not shipped in this repository) ==

DB-IP Lite (https://db-ip.com)
  IP Geolocation by DB-IP, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

IPinfo Lite (https://ipinfo.io), optional
  IP address data is powered by IPinfo, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

People Data Labs free company dataset (https://www.peopledatalabs.com/company-dataset)
  Company data (c) People Data Labs, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/); modified (filtered to US companies with a
  website, optionally to a workspace's ICP; LinkedIn-derived fields removed). Imported on the
  server by the company-universe import; each account page credits it on the fields it filled.

SEC EDGAR company tickers (https://www.sec.gov/files/company_tickers_exchange.json)
  U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission public data; used to tag companies with their
  CIK and ticker.
